    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\int 4 \\cos \\left(x+\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) \\cos 2 x \\cdot \\cos \\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{6}+x\\right) d x \\\\\n& =2 \\int\\left(\\cos (2 x+\\pi) \\cos \\frac{2 \\pi}{3}\\right) \\cos 2 x d x \\\\\n& =2 \\int\\left(-\\cos 2 x-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\cos 2 x d x \\\\\n& =\\int\\left(-2 \\cos ^2 2 x-\\cos 2 x\\right) d x \\\\\n& =-\\int(1+\\cos 4 x+\\cos 2 x) d x \\\\\n& =-x-\\frac{\\sin 4 x}{x}-\\frac{\\sin 2 x}{2}+c\n\\end{aligned}\\)"
